---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";

const lastUpdated = "24 September 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Deal Estate Terms of Service | Zondo Studios"
  description="Terms governing your use of Deal Estate, a mobile card game from Zondo Studios."
>
  <Nav />

  <section class="pt-32 pb-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight gradient-text">Deal Estate Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500 font-mono">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-12">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of Deal Estate (the "Service"), a mobile card game operated by Zondo Studios ("we", "us", or "our"), an independent Australian software studio, available as an app for iOS and Android.
          </p>
          <p>
            By creating an account or using the Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the Service.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">2. Eligibility</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            You must be at least 13 years of age to use Deal Estate. By using the Service, you represent and warrant that you meet this age requirement and have the legal capacity to enter into these Terms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">3. Your Account</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            You can use Deal Estate as a Guest, without providing any personal information, or sign in with your Apple or Google account. Signing in with Apple or Google lets you keep your history and stats if you reinstall the app or switch devices; a Guest can link an Apple or Google account later and keep their existing history.
          </p>
          <p>You are responsible for all activity that occurs under your account, and you agree to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Provide accurate information where you choose to provide it (for example, your display name)</li>
            <li>Notify us if you believe your account has been accessed without authorisation</li>
            <li>Not share access to your account with any third party</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">4. Service Description</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Deal Estate is a property-dealing card game with original mechanics and card names. The Service lets you:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Play offline against an AI opponent</li>
            <li>Play online in real-time ranked multiplayer matches</li>
            <li>Track your match history, win/loss record, and rating on a global leaderboard, calculated using the Glicko-2 rating system</li>
            <li>Add friends and send friend requests to other players</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Deal Estate is currently free to use, with no in-app purchases and no advertising. The global leaderboard and ranking system are cosmetic only. There is no wagering, no real-money prizes, and no gambling mechanic of any kind in the Service.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">5. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>You agree not to use the Service to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Violate any applicable law or regulation</li>
            <li>Infringe on the rights of any third party</li>
            <li>Transmit malicious code, spam, or harmful content</li>
            <li>Attempt to gain unauthorised access to the Service or its infrastructure</li>
            <li>Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble any part of the Service</li>
            <li>Create multiple accounts to circumvent usage limits or ranked matchmaking</li>
            <li>Use cheats, bots, scripts, or exploits to gain an unfair advantage in ranked play</li>
            <li>Abuse the friends or matchmaking systems, including to harass, spam, or impersonate other players</li>
            <li>Harass, threaten, or abuse other players through in-game social features</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">6. Your Data</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            You retain ownership of the profile and gameplay data associated with your account. You grant us a limited licence to store, process, and display that data solely for the purpose of providing the Service to you and other players (for example, showing your username and stats to opponents and friends).
          </p>
          <p>
            For details on what we collect and how we handle it, see our <a href="/deal-estate/privacy" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">7. Mobile App &amp; Notifications</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Deal Estate is provided as a native app for iOS and Android under these Terms. If you enable push notifications, we may send you alerts about turn changes and match activity. You can disable notifications at any time in your device settings.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">8. Service Availability</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            We strive to keep the Service available at all times but do not guarantee uninterrupted access. The Service may be temporarily unavailable due to maintenance, updates, or circumstances beyond our control.
          </p>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of the Service at any time with reasonable notice where practicable.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, the Service is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied.
          </p>
          <p>
            We are not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Service, including but not limited to loss of data or loss of progress.
          </p>
          <p>
            Nothing in these Terms excludes, restricts, or modifies any consumer guarantee, right, or remedy that cannot be excluded under the consumer-protection laws of your country of residence.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">10. Indemnification</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Zondo Studios from any claims, damages, losses, or expenses (including legal fees) arising from your use of the Service or violation of these Terms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">11. Termination</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            You may terminate your account at any time by deleting it from the app's Settings screen. Upon deletion, your account and associated data are permanently removed in line with our <a href="/deal-estate/privacy" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            We may suspend or terminate your access to the Service if you violate these Terms, with or without notice depending on the severity of the violation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">12. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            We may update these Terms from time to time. When we make material changes, we will update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page and, where practicable, notify you in-app.
          </p>
          <p>
            Your continued use of the Service after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the updated Terms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">13. Governing Law</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Deal Estate is operated by Zondo Studios from Australia and is available to users worldwide. These Terms are governed by the laws of South Australia, and the courts of South Australia have non-exclusive jurisdiction over any dispute arising from your use of the Service.
          </p>
          <p>
            Nothing in these Terms limits, excludes, or modifies any non-excludable consumer-protection right available to you under the laws of your country of residence (for example, the Australian Consumer Law, the EU/UK consumer-rights regime, or US state-specific consumer statutes). Where a provision of these Terms conflicts with such a non-excludable right, that right prevails.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">14. Contact Us</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            If you have questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at:
          </p>
          <p>
            <a href="mailto:help@zondostudios.com" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline">help@zondostudios.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
